<h2 style="color:lightslategray">4. Text Formatting Tag</h2>
<p> <b>Bold text</b>using the b tag</p>
<p> <strong>strong(important)text</strong>using the strong tag</p>
<p> <i>Italic text</i>using the i tag</p>
<p> <em>Emphasized text</em>using the em tag</p>
<p> <small>small text</small>using the small tag</p>
<p> Water formula: H<sub>2</sub>O using the sub tag</p>
<p>Einstein's equation: E=mc<sup>2</sup> using the sup tag</p>
